    q: "What city rental packages are available for local cabs in Chennai?",
    a: "We offer 5 standard packages designed for Chennai travel: 4 Hours / 40 KM (Quick errands/shopping), 5 Hours / 50 KM (Half day), 8 Hours / 80 KM (Standard full day), 10 Hours / 100 KM (Extended business), and 12 Hours / 120 KM (Full-day events and functions)."
